{% endif %}

## Run

```
cargo run            # dev profile
cargo run --release
```

{% if t.cortex_m and o.build_info %}
`RAM_LINK=1 cargo run` links and runs from RAM (flash content untouched; power-cycle restores the old firmware).

{% endif %}
{% if t.family == "rp" %}
